  "shadow": {
    "note": "Depth shadows describe surface elevation. Inset surfaces get a 1px lift, overlays get a real shadow, and other surfaces stay flat. Focus, selection, errors and pressed states use outlines, borders and color. The canonical primary Button is the only exception for colored inset face and hover illumination. All of its light stays inside the control; it has no external or drop shadow.",
    "tokens": [
      {
