  },
  "opacity": {
    "note": "Opacity steps. row-dim fades the other rows of a table body while one row is being edited. nudge is the focus ring: a focused field draws a size-focus-ring ring of ink at this opacity outside a 1px ink border, and a focused invalid field draws the same ring in bad outside a bad border. Fields at rest have no ring, invalid ones included.",
    "tokens": [
