        "usage": "Cell contents of the other rows in a table body while a row is focused for editing (TableRow focused, DataTable focusedRowId), applied as filter: opacity so it composes with opacity reveals inside the cells. Row grounds, borders, headers and portalled popovers stay at full strength."
